          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "sdc01_0010_ecology_06",
      "hash64": "4FF119C5AFE061FA",
      "text": "Vraiment ? C’est-à-dire que, euh... Sans l’accord\\nde monsieur Clavel ou de la Ligue, je...[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
